@startuml
skin rose
title SMTP demo via Telnet (command/response)

autonumber
actor User as "Пользователь"
participant Telnet as "Telnet client"
participant SMTP as "MailHog SMTP :1025"
participant UI as "MailHog UI :8025"

User -> Telnet: telnet localhost 1025
Telnet -> SMTP: TCP connect
SMTP --> Telnet: 220 mailhog ESMTP ready

User -> Telnet: EHLO demo.local + Enter
Telnet -> SMTP: EHLO demo.local
SMTP --> Telnet: 250-mailhog
SMTP --> Telnet: 250-PIPELINING
SMTP --> Telnet: 250 AUTH PLAIN LOGIN

User -> Telnet: MAIL FROM:<demo@local.test> + Enter
Telnet -> SMTP: MAIL FROM:<demo@local.test>
SMTP --> Telnet: 250 Sender ok

User -> Telnet: RCPT TO:<student@example.com> + Enter
Telnet -> SMTP: RCPT TO:<student@example.com>
SMTP --> Telnet: 250 Recipient ok

User -> Telnet: DATA + Enter
Telnet -> SMTP: DATA
SMTP --> Telnet: 354 End data with <CRLF>.<CRLF>

User -> Telnet: Subject: SMTP demo via telnet + Enter
Telnet -> SMTP: Subject: SMTP demo via telnet

User -> Telnet: (пустая строка) + Enter
Telnet -> SMTP: <empty line>

User -> Telnet: Hello from raw SMTP over telnet. + Enter
Telnet -> SMTP: Hello from raw SMTP over telnet.

User -> Telnet: . + Enter
Telnet -> SMTP: .
SMTP --> Telnet: 250 Message queued as <id>

User -> Telnet: QUIT + Enter
Telnet -> SMTP: QUIT
SMTP --> Telnet: 221 Bye

User -> UI: Открывает http://localhost:8025
UI -> SMTP: Запрос списка писем
SMTP --> UI: Новое письмо
UI --> User: Письмо отображено

@enduml